        "original_id": "bd1fdc35-b7b0-5fb0-ae70-cbc4dce5ed74",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stephen Quay, Timothy Quay, Alexandra Shiva, William Tuckett\n- Roles: film producer, director\n- Works: The Chairs, Bombay Eunuch, How to Dance in Ohio, The Sandman\n- Events: Drama Desk Award, Sundance Film Festival\n\nFacts:\n- Stephen Quay and Timothy Quay were born on June 17, 1947, and are American identical twin brothers known as the Brothers Quay or Quay Brothers.\n- Alexandra Shiva is an American film producer and director.\n- Alexandra Shiva's 2001 film \"Bombay Eunuch\" was award-winning.\n- The 2000 dance film \"The Sandman\" was made by the Brothers Quay and William Tuckett.\n- Stephen Quay and Timothy Quay received the 1998 Drama Desk Award for Outstanding Set Design for their work on the play \"The Chairs.\"\n- Alexandra Shiva showed \"How to Dance in Ohio\" at the 2015 Sundance Film Festival in the US Documentary Competition.",
